      "note": "Savage Planet is a sonic journey into the wild. An introduction to a world with no rules - a world where instincts subjugate convention and imagination is your only compass. \n\nThis concept was spurred from a moment in both producers' lives where they simultaneously felt inspired to let go of the traditional pop structure they were so used to adhering to. Instead, they chose to create music that mirrored a free flow of consciousness that came about as a direct result of the inspiration they felt when creating this music. As a result, most of the project was created in one night.\n\nCreative Direction and Production by Xmane and Pete Rango\n3D Animation: Nawt Creative",
      "originalRelease": "https://zora.co/collect/eth:0x10d32bf55f5cbe66b068f2109ecf7475f0631d53/1",
