      "note": "Savage Planet is a sonic journey into the wild. An introduction to a world with no rules - a world where instincts subjugate convention and imagination is your only compass. \n\nInspired by “Le Planete Sauvage”, a movie that featured aliens and humans alike in a wild planet inhabited by a variety of beasts and creatures beyond anything seen by the human eye before the film’s release - The medium displayed several moments that garnered our attention; from moments of light playfulness, moments of violence and aggression as well as moments so bizarre one could only watch and see how the situation evolved. \n\nCreative Direction and Production by Xmane and Pete Rango\n3D Animation: Nawt Creative",
