      "note": "When I started this song and thrifted this jacket I had no plan for how they would turn out and it has led me to fall in love with creating in more than one medium. I hope the jacket and this song can be a reminder to express yourself in whatever medium feels best. \n\nSong produced by Pete Rango \nArt work by @ nawtcreative \n\nAny holders of this token\n- Entered for a chance to win a hand painted jacket that will be chosen in a live twitter space 3/27\n- Allow listed for my next drop ",
